          "bullets": [
            "xAI says Grok Voice 3.0 ranks first on Artificial Analysis's Speech-to-Speech Index with a score of 86.9, against 83.2 for GPT-Live-1 (Astra, Medium), 82.6 for Gemini 3.8 Live (Ext. Thinking, High) and 81.3 for its own Grok Voice 2.0, citing Artificial Analysis data dated October 13, 2026.",
