          "bullets": [
            "Katti said on Wednesday that he is leaving after roughly a year, with a last day of Nov. 15, and will continue to support OpenAI as an advisor; Uday Ruddarraju, OpenAI's CTO of compute, will replace him and lead the company's overall compute organisation, a spokesperson told CNBC.",
