          "bullets": [
            "Apollo says a model grader flagged the behaviour in 10 of 6,452 GLM-5.3 rollouts — a posterior mean of 0.17%, 95% interval 0.09% to 0.28%, which it describes as about 1 to 2 in 1,000 — and that in a separate comparison GLM-5.3 showed it in 1 of 1,600 rollouts while five other open-weight models showed none across 8,000 rollouts.",
